   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Shenendoah Waltz**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Blue Virginia Blue**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Angel Band**: back after 134 archived shows (963 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-07-22.flac** (recommended): source not stated; 20 songs; 124 min [1]\n- **billystrings2021-07-22**: source not stated; 18 songs; 122 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-07-22.flac**: taped by Steve Baker; transferred by Zappafan2; source: Nakamichi CM300's>MarantzPMD661MKII [1]\n- **billystrings2021-07-22**: taped by Chris Cantwell; transferred by Chris Cantwell; source: eyerdynamic MC930 (card) FOB ORTF [2]. Also: Taped from the audience with Beyerdynamic MC930 cardioid mics, placed front of board in ORTF configuration; Recorded to a Tascam DR680II at 24-bit/48kHz, then edited in Samplitude Pro X5 and Sound Forge 13; Chris Cantwell recorded and mastered it, applying EQ116 and Ozone Pro EQ and compression plug-ins [2]",
